{"2170650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mobilization", "steam_appid": 2170650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person shooter. Light humor, dynamics and action will allow you to return to the atmosphere of first-person shooters of the 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/dbafd1eaf63182309b670d75a112bed1.avif?t=1787901889\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras_big/dbafd1eaf63182309b670d75a112bed1.avif?t=1787901889 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive first-person shooter in the classic tradition of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not necessary to know languages ​​​​and read a lot of text, just go and destroy everything around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing knives, grenades, bombs and a whole arsenal of small arms will help you have fun and achieve any goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/806a2dc2c796efb0a93174d08edeee02.avif?t=1787901889\" width=480 height=270 /></span>At any time, you can always improve the properties of your weapon. Increase power, put a laser sight and other modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near the fire extinguisher you will often find something to replenish your health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/78f27d81f7dc7fb521df9742612b750f.avif?t=1787901889\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By pressing the Esc (pause) button during the game you will see a list of all control buttons and change the graphics settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/110b7a34dfe1893af00bc8fb763b3abc.avif?t=1787901889\" width=480 height=270 /></span>Controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/986076303f20701dee0cad32480daf27.avif?t=1787901889\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a little background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mercenary army financed by a group of hostile nations under the command of a fugitive general Jonathan Badon </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >captured the Allied military base on one of the islands in the Pacific Ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiments with biological weapons are being carried out there, the purpose of which is the destruction of our country and allied states.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have selected the best of the best to participate in the operation to regain control of the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must recapture the base at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your group act immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to destroy the enemy manpower and regain control over the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code name for Operation &quot;Mobilization&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person shooter. Light humor, dynamics and action will allow you to return to the atmosphere of first-person shooters of the 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/extras/dbafd1eaf63