0cad32480daf27.avif?t=1787901889\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a little background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mercenary army financed by a group of hostile nations under the command of a fugitive general Jonathan Badon </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >captured the Allied military base on one of the islands in the Pacific Ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiments with biological weapons are being carried out there, the purpose of which is the destruction of our country and allied states.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have selected the best of the best to participate in the operation to regain control of the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must recapture the base at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your group act immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to destroy the enemy manpower and regain control over the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code name for Operation &quot;Mobilization&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>", "short_description": "First-person Shooter. Light humor, dynamics and action will allow you to return to the atmosphere of first person shooters of the 90s. Throwing knives, grenades, bombs and a whole arsenal of small arms will help you have fun and achieve any goal.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/5782563287c0c7af1c75c969af722e25efa02412/header.jpg?t=1787901889", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/c4b6518a5734265f562b52743f8c0dc3ca5ff93f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787901889", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170650/c4b6518a5734265f562b52743f8c0dc3ca5ff93f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787901889", "website": "http://igorg